          "regex": "(?im)^[ \\t]*(?:BMI|Body Mass Index)\\s*[:\\-]\\s*(?P<value>\\d{1,2}(?:\\.\\d+)?)(?:[ \\t]*(?:kg/m(?:2|²)))?"
        },
        {
          "regex": "(?im)^[ \\t]*(?:BMI|Body Mass Index)(?:[ \\t]*\\((?:calculated|reported)\\))?[ \\t]*\\r?\\n[ \\t]*(?P<value>\\d{1,2}(?:\\.\\d+)?)[ \\t]*$"
